# URLs lychee skips. One regex per line. Every lychee run reads this file on
# its own; it matters for the weekly external-link check (links.yml).

# npmjs.com package pages return 403 Forbidden to automated clients, so lychee
# reports them as broken although they work in a browser. The packages were
# verified via registry.npmjs.org, which returns 200 for both. Only this host
# is skipped; registry.npmjs.org and every other host are still checked.
# Found in #242.
^https://www\.npmjs\.com/
